  "skills": "3.E: Calculate appropriate statistical inference method results",
  "difficulty": "2 — Application",
  "stem": "A company claims that 60% of its customers are satisfied. In a random sample of 150 customers, 78 (52%) are satisfied. For H₀: p = 0.60 versus Hₐ: p < 0.60, and assuming the conditions are met, what are the test statistic and p-value?",
