  "difficulty": "2 — Application",
  "stem": "Delivery times for a company’s packages are strongly skewed right with mean 30 minutes and standard deviation 12 minutes. For random samples of n = 64 deliveries, which describes the sampling distribution of the sample mean x̄?",
